# Named groups for classnet-release --to @group:NAME
#
# Copy to groups.txt in this directory, which is gitignored: a filled-in file
# names real students by GitHub username, and this repository is public.
# bin/classnet-release reads the copy HERE, in your working tree -- not the
# one on the router -- or $CS326_GROUPS if you set it.
#
# One per line:   name: githubuser1 githubuser2 ...
#
# Example:
# makeup-thu: jsmith alopez
# section-b:  rpatel kwong tnguyen
